  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Climate and Health Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment addresses the growing concern in the Pacific regarding the impacts that climate change is having and will have on health systems, workforce and overall health of communities. The agreement under this investment with DoHAC will deliver a Pacific Climate and Health Package resulting in a regional survey, regional workshops, assistance with adaptation plans and a COP31 health programme with the Pacific.</narrative>
  </description>
